msgctxt "66\t186"
msgid "Now then. Tell me what you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "187\t267"
msgid "I don't got answers for ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268\t394"
msgid "Don't be ridiculous.\\nYou can't expect me to fall for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "395\t497"
msgid "You're the ones who murdered\\nKashiwagi-san. Aren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "498\t614"
msgid "Fuck no! What would I gain outta\\nbumpin' the captain off!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "615\t776"
msgid "You want to be the next Tojo chairman.\\nSo you made a job opening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "777\t862"
msgid "Ya got it wrong! Just hear me out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "863\t997"
msgid "The... The guy who offed the captain...\\nIt was Hamazaki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1002\t1041"
msgid "Hamazaki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1042\t1210"
msgid ""
"Bingo! He's aimin' to control all of Kamurocho!\\nGuy had a motive for axing"
" Kashiwagi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1211\t1259"
msgid "Explain."
msgstr "Si spieghi."

msgctxt "1293\t1438"
msgid ""
"He's got a whole army holed up in Yokohama!\\nJust waitin' for a chance to "
"strike!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1439\t1630"
msgid ""
"It's the truth! Chinese guy we nabbed in our\\nterritory told us! Totally "
"spilled the beans!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1661\t1721"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr "Capo"

msgctxt "1795\t1842"
msgid "Everything okay with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1843\t1893"
msgid "More or less."
msgstr "Più o meno."

msgctxt "1894\t1993"
msgid "There were a lot of 'em,\\nso it kinda took a while..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2106\t2214"
msgid "I'm gonna run ya through!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2487\t2587"
msgid "This... is Kanda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2588\t2635"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "2636\t2772"
msgid "Hold up. What happened to askin' him stuff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2779\t2932"
msgid "I got what I need. Besides, there's\\nno way he planned all this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2933\t3105"
msgid "I doubt he even knows why Daigo\\ngot shot in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3140\t3266"
msgid "Jeez. Tokyo's a scary place, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3308\t3354"
msgid "Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3355\t3485"
msgid "I promise you.\\nI'll figure out who shot Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3512\t3603"
msgid "So do me a favor.\\nGo back to Okinawa and⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3604\t3664"
msgid "Not happenin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3673\t3721"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3722\t3865"
msgid "I need to track down the guy\\nwho attacked Patriarch Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3854\t3913"
msgid "I need revenge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3955\t4082"
msgid "So please, Aniki!\\nLet me stay in Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4083\t4143"
msgid "I'm beggin' you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4232\t4292"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "4302\t4404"
msgid "But I have one condition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4483\t4709"
msgid ""
"If you come across the man in the sketch,\\ndon't go after him on your own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4710\t4770"
msgid "Can you promise me that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4847\t4907"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "4988\t5048"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "5068\t5148"
msgid "Now, how about we grab a drink?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5158\t5241"
msgid "I can show you the sights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5273\t5392"
msgid "I'll prove this town's\\nnot as scary as you think."
msgstr ""
